{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0532_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0532_1000_p", "source_sha256": "86f330108d250438909b1a4ab9628d05d3f314c101f22d3aa4277b6d7c0ea06c", "ja": "（劇場を飾り、みんな揃ってのクリスマスパーティーが\n終わった。みんな、楽しそうな顔をしていたな）", "zh": "（装饰好剧场后，大家一起参加的圣诞派对结束了。大家看起来都很开心啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0532_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0532_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1b0f83ed4d339aa338b926145ffae0154da5d6b3df3add25dd8aa6c415f095d9", "ja": "よいしょ……。\nパーティーの片付け、手伝ってくれてありがとな。", "zh": "嘿咻……  \n谢谢你帮忙收拾派对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0532_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0532_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "ca6fa043252f5d52a45405a418b92b2f06c8285cbc0bcfd9096b356ddbba873f", "ja": "いいっていいって。あたしも楽しかったしさ。\nみんなで準備したり、片付けしたり……。", "zh": "没事没事，我也挺开心的。\n大家一起准备，一起收拾……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0532_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0532_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "cb25a48ed4970f06e469900b74cc43574d699bf5645d6009c01f48381736cf5a", "ja": "もちろん、パーティーもな。料理に歌にプレゼントまで\n……。この手作り感が、なんかウチららしいよな。", "zh": "当然，还有派对。做饭、唱歌，甚至连礼物都是我们准备的……\n这种亲手制作的感觉，总觉得很像我们呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0532_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0532_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4a3043820372e2b4e924134507adbf6d904e152891672bad5144ff64c9356003", "ja": "そうだな。\nまあ、いつまでこんな風に出来るかわからないけど。", "zh": "是啊。\n不过，也不知道还能像这样做到什么时候。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0532_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0532_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "721c6eb168c7500964a5c0801a98e8729133fa2f9a32cb9a0f21789acbe5eae1", "ja": "うーん……トップスターになっても、\nウチらは手作りのパーティーをしてる気がするよ。", "zh": "嗯……就算成了顶级明星，\n我觉得咱们也还是会举办这种亲手准备的派对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0532_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0532_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "13ed1113251aefb32a9a25cb0945a7c14961cda08592f88932f4eeec8738985f", "ja": "劇場を飾って、料理やプレゼントを持ち寄ってさ。\nだって、ここは家みたいなもんだろ？", "zh": "装饰剧场，大家各自带来料理和礼物。\n因为这里就像家一样，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0532_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0532_1007_p", "source_sha256": "eb62533b36e4decfe7bf401da868d39f30c3637edee2076f814f1585a436a9a4", "ja": "ジュリア……。そんな風に思って……！", "zh": "茱莉亚……。居然会这么想……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0532_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0532_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "e764fd161264d2ecd4980bf3be40ddf838151ab7d5b69eee5a8e80d371c1cf54", "ja": "！！　あ、あんた相手だと、口が滑りすぎる。\n……今の話、みんなにはヒミツな？", "zh": "！！啊、啊啊翼！在你面前，我真是太容易说漏嘴了。\n……刚才的话，可别告诉大家啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
